3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-rRCEdbn8%5C%22%3Edeveloper_id%E5%92%8Capp_id%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%B0%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-chBXLG3k\">url中的{app_id}与{developer_id}需替换为开发者自身创建账户以及应用信息</p><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"udcdd064-SYo978V5\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-P6U1NZcX\">例如:<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/sse?app_id=123456789&amp;developer_id=12345\">https://open.oceanengine.com/sse?app_id=123456789&amp;developer_id=12345</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rRCEdbn8\">developer_id和app_id可在开发者后台查询，需对应关系一致</li></ul></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-D73DgWOA\" id=\"h490b8bf-8PLbbqdE\">工具列表</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-id=\"t49383ef-g0J3fTZ6\" data-custom=\"true\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-RZD4Cheb\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"ccefbf2a-W1mc4FAR\" width=\"296\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c6488aff-4BEchBVU\" width=\"583\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-ak8ZR2cY\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-C7bDMIMM\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-KHkUHQ30\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-94TgxnZ0\">工具名称</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-HaVJhPVe\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ygstn4np\">工具介绍</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-iOfQHlYp\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-JSD8D8mb\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VtgT5HXt\">open_api_doc_gen</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-l4BCmDmW\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zVFobmpM\">用于检索召回巨量引擎开放平台的文档内容，该工具的返回值包含了检索到的文档内容以及接口对应的path</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-kmMOajaf\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-hoNNYGab\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yatsXk7V\">open_api_schema_gen</p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-dEp4j772\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LpTV6IvH\">依据接口path查询对应巨量引擎开放平台的接口schema，返回格式为OpenApi规范的yaml格式</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-MMVEaG6W\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t8e94736-ikdWBQO5\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BIRS4GNa\">open_sdk_example_code_tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t5bc59a3-CdllfhMh\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BaTbtMn5\">依据接口path查询对应接口的sdk调用代码，该sdk为巨量引擎开放平台提供的sdk，本工具需要用户明确要求按照sdk风格生成，返回值为sdk调用代码片段</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-Mg1AHlkd\" id=\"h490b8bf-Fqgtr1xb\">示例场景</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-83m6Nhq4\">在支持的客户端配置以上MCP Server后，你可能尝试询问LLM模型的事情：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LQdjXeIf\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VlZeghDq\">使用巨量引擎开发工具基于Sdk帮忙写一段调用 /open_api/v3.0/promotion/list/ 接口的代码</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DeoNKGBp\">使用巨量引擎开发工具查询下近期更新日志发布的内容，并总结下重点改动信息</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-18XJ5Ac3\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-uDUC9Wez\"><br></p></div>",
